hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"916","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas they, jabke unhon ne ek mard ki awaz suni jo Hafsa ke ghar mein ijazat mang raha tha. Aisha ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main use falan samajhti hun [Hafsa ke doodh ke chacha ke liye]. Aisha ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye mard hai jo tumhare ghar mein ijazat mang raha hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main use falan samajhta hun [Hafsa ke doodh ke chacha ke liye]. Phir Aisha ne kaha: Agar falan zinda hota [un ke doodh ke chacha ke liye] to wo mere paas dakhil hota? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Haan. Beshak doodh haram karta hai jo wiladat se haram hota hai."
"917","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aflah bhai Abu al-Qu'ais ne parda nazil hone ke baad mujh se ijazat mangi. To main ne kaha: Main use ijazat nahi dungi yahan tak ke is mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat lun. Kyunke us ke bhai Abu al-Qu'ais ne mujhe doodh nahi pilaya, lekin mujhe Abu al-Qu'ais ki biwi ne doodh pilaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue. To main ne Aap se arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Aflah bhai Abu al-Qu'ais ne ijazat mangi to main ne inkar kiya ke ijazat dun yahan tak ke tum se ijazat lun. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhe apne chacha ko ijazat dene se kya rokta hai? Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mard ne mujhe doodh nahi pilaya, lekin mujhe Abu al-Qu'ais ki biwi ne doodh pilaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use ijazat do, kyunke wo tumhara chacha hai. Tumhara dayan hath khaak-aalood ho."
"918","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aflah ne mujh se ijazat mangi to main ne use ijazat na di. Phir us ne kaha: Kya tum mujh se parda karti ho jabke main tumhara chacha hun? To main ne kaha: Wo kaise? Us ne kaha: Tumhe mere bhai ki biwi ne mere bhai ke doodh se doodh pilaya. To unhon ne kaha: Main ne is ke bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Aflah ne sach kaha. Use ijazat do."
"919","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hamza ki beti ke bare mein farmaya: Wo mere liye halal nahi. Doodh se wo haram hota hai jo nasab se haram hota hai. Wo doodh se meri bhatiji hai."
"920","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Habiba (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tumhe Abu Sufyan ki beti mein raghbat hai? Aap ne farmaya: Phir main kya karun? Main ne arz kiya: Tum nikah karo. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum pasand karti ho? Main ne arz kiya: Main tumhare liye khali nahi hun. Aur jo mere sath tum mein shareek ho wo mujhe sab se mehboob hai, meri behan. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo mere liye halal nahi. Main ne arz kiya: Mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke tum paigham bhejte ho. Aap ne farmaya: Umm Salama ki beti? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo meri parwarish mein na hoti to mere liye halal na hoti. Mujhe aur us ke walid ko Thuwaiba ne doodh pilaya tha. Phir mujh par apni betiyan aur behnein pesh na karo."
"921","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke mere paas ek mard tha. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Ye kaun hai? Main ne arz kiya: Doodh se mera bhai. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Dekho tumhare bhai kaun hain. Kyunke doodh bhook se hai."
"922","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas aur Abd bin Zam'a ek ladke mein jhagde. To Sa'd ne kaha: Ae Rasulullah! Ye mere bhai Utba bin Abi Waqqas ka beta hai. Us ne mujh se ahad kiya tha ke wo us ka beta hai. Us ki mushabehat dekho. Aur Abd bin Zam'a ne kaha: Ye mera bhai hai, Ya Rasulullah! Mere walid ke bistar par us ki londi se paida hua. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki mushabehat dekhi aur Utba se wazeh mushabehat dekhi. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo tumhara hai ae Abd. Beta bistar wale ka hai aur zaniya ke liye pathar hai. Aur us se parda karo ae Sauda bint Zam'a! Phir Sauda ne use kabhi nahi dekha."
"923","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beta bistar wale ka hai."
"924","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek din Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke Wo khush they. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke Mujazziz al-Mudliji dakhil hua aur Usama aur Zaid ko dekha, jabke un par qateefa thi jis se unhon ne apne sar dhanpe they, aur un ke paon zahir they. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak ye paon ek doosre mein se hain."
"925","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sunnat mein se hai ke jab mard kunwari se nikah kare, bewah par, to us ke paas saat rahe aur taqseem kare. Aur jab bewah se nikah kare, kunwari par, to us ke paas teen rahe, phir taqseem kare."
"926","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main un par ghairat karti jo apni jaanein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hadiya kartin. Aur kehti: Kya aurat apni jaan hadiya karti hai? Phir jab Allah Ta'ala ne ye nazil farmaya [tum un mein se jise chaho muakkhar karo, jise chaho apne paas rakho, jise tum ne alag kiya us mein se jise chaho, tum par koi gunah nahi] to main ne kaha: Main tumhare Rab ko nahi dekhti magar tumhari khwahish mein jaldi karta hai."
"927","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Ata ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ibn Abbas ke sath Sarif mein Maimuna ke janaze mein hazir hue. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Ye Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwi hain. Phir jab tum un ka janaza uthao to use na hilao na jhunjhlao, aur narmi karo. Kyunke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas nau thein. Aap aath ke liye taqseem farmate aur ek ke liye taqseem na farmate."
"928","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aurat se chaar ke liye nikah kiya jata hai: Us ke maal, hasab, husn aur deen ke liye. Phir deen wali se kamyabi pao, tumhare hath khaak-aalood hon."
"929","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne nikah kiya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tum ne kya nikah kiya? To main ne arz kiya: Main ne bewah se nikah kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe kunwariyon se aur un ke khel se kya? Muharib ne kaha [sanad ke ek rawi]: Phir main ne is ka Amr bin Dinar se zikr kiya. To Amr ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kunwari kyun nahi jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khele?"
"930","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid halak hue aur saat ya nau betiyan chhorein. Phir main ne bewah aurat se nikah kiya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Jabir! Tum ne nikah kiya? To main ne arz kiya: Haan. To Aap ne farmaya: Kunwari ya bewah? Main ne arz kiya: Balke bewah. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kunwari kyun nahi jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khele, jis se tum hanseo aur wo tum se hanse? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Aap se arz kiya: Beshak Abdullah halak hue aur betiyan chhorein. Aur beshak main ne na-pasand kiya ke main un ke paas un jaisi laun. Phir main ne us aurat se nikah kiya jo un ki dekh-bhaal kare aur unhe durust kare. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah barkat de, ya bhalayi."
"931","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek ladayi mein tha. Phir jab hum laute to main katran oont par jaldi karne laga. Phir mere peechhe se ek sawar mujhe paya. Phir main ne tawajjah ki to main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tha. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe kya jaldi hai? Main ne arz kiya: Beshak main naya dulha hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kunwari se nikah kiya ya bewah se? Main ne arz kiya: Balke bewah se. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kunwari kyun nahi jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khele? Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab hum aaye to hum ne dakhil hona chaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Thehro yahan tak ke raat mein dakhil ho, matlab shaam mein, taake bikhar baalon wali kanghi kare aur ghayab wali safayi kare. Aur is hadith mein hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Samajhdari, samajhdari ae Jabir! Matlab beta."
"932","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek ladayi mein tha. To mera oont sust ho gaya aur thak gaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas tashreef laye. To Aap ne farmaya: Jabir? To main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hai? Main ne arz kiya: Mera oont sust ho gaya hai aur thak gaya hai, to main peechhe reh gaya. Phir Aap ne apni chhadi se use hankaya. Phir farmaya: Sawar ho. Phir main sawar hua. Phir beshak main ne use dekha ke main use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se rokta tha. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne nikah kiya? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kunwari ya bewah? Main ne arz kiya: Balke bewah. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kunwari kyun nahi jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khele? Main ne arz kiya: Meri behnein hain. Phir main ne pasand kiya ke us aurat se nikah karun jo unhe jama kare, unhe kanghi kare aur un ki dekh-bhaal kare. Aap ne farmaya: Suno! Beshak tum aane wale ho. Phir jab tum aao to samajhdari, samajhdari. Phir farmaya: Kya tum apna oont bechte ho? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Aap ne use mujh se ooqiya mein khareeda. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujh se pehle tashreef laye, aur main subah aaya. Phir hum masjid aaye to Aap ko masjid ke darwaze par paya. Aap ne farmaya: Ab aaye ho? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Apna oont chhoro aur dakhil ho kar do rakatein parho. Phir main dakhil hua aur namaz parhi. Phir Aap ne Bilal ko hukm diya ke use ooqiya tole. Phir Bilal ne mere liye tola aur tarazu mein zyada kiya. Phir main chala yahan tak ke peeth pher gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye Jabir ko bulao. Main ne kaha: Ab Aap mujh par oont lautayenge. Aur mujhe us se zyada koi cheez na-pasand na thi. Unhon ne kaha: Apna oont lo, aur tumhare liye us ki qeemat hai."
"933","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aurat pasli jaisi hai. Agar tum use seedha karoge to use tod doge. Aur agar us se faida uthayoge to us se faida uthayoge jabke us mein tedhapan hai."
"934","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai wo apne padosi ko takleef na de. Aur aurton se bhalayi ki wasiyyat karo, kyunke wo pasli se paida ki gayi hain. Aur pasli mein sab se tedhi cheez us ka upar hai. Phir agar tum use seedha karne jao to use tod doge. Aur agar use chhor do to wo tedhi rahegi. Phir aurton se bhalayi ki wasiyyat karo."
"935","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar Bani Israil na hote to gosht na sadta. Aur agar Hawwa na hotin to koi aurat apne shohar se khayanat na karti."
